# Artifacts of `tree-sitter parse` / `tree-sitter test`, which compile the
# grammar in place on Windows. The GENERATED SOURCES (src/parser.c,
# src/grammar.json, src/node-types.json, src/tree_sitter/) are committed on
# purpose — that is what lets `cargo build` work without Node.
*.obj
*.lib
*.exp
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
